Package: dtcvalid
Title: Validate SDTM --DTC Values Against ISO 8601
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Drikus", "Raath", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "drikusraath@gmail.com")
Description: Checks SDTM --DTC character values against the ISO 8601 subset
    described in SDTMIG v3.4 section 4.4 and reports a reason for each value
    that fails. Imputation is out of scope.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), tibble
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
